{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43258","headline":"风光草际浮 · 陈祜","name":"风光草际浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香发王孙草，春生君子风。\n光摇低偃处，影散艳阳中。\n稍稍移苹末，微微转蕙丛。\n浮烟倾绿野，远色澹晴空。\n泛彩池塘媚，含芳景气融。\n清晖谁不挹，几许赏心同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}